# Test Intent: MovingElement

Site: nordbank-probes
Requested by: monitoring team
Date: 2026-07-13

## Target URL

Open the file `probes/moving-element/index.html`.

## Desired Flow

I opened the page. A small orange diamond badge sat somewhere inside a large
bordered area — and it moved to a different spot each time I reloaded. I clicked
the badge and the status changed to "Caught the badge!".

## Element Hints

- The badge moves to a new position on every visit, so its coordinates and DOM
  path are not reliable. It looks like @assets/badge.png — match it as an image
  and click wherever it currently is.

## Values to Capture

(none)

## Success Criteria

The moving badge is clicked wherever it happens to be (status becomes "Caught the
badge!").

